---
const stats = [
  {
    value: '73%',
    body: 'of consumers say a professional domain name makes them more likely to trust a business. VanityWax.com signals legitimacy before a single service is rendered.',
  },
  {
    value: '2.5×',
    body: 'Businesses with exact-match or branded .com domains see up to 2.5× higher click-through rates in organic search results versus hyphenated or alternative TLD competitors.',
  },
  {
    value: '10Y',
    body: 'Premium .com domains have appreciated over the last decade as digital real estate. Owning VanityWax.com is owning a long-term appreciating asset.',
  },
  {
    value: '#1',
    body: 'A strong domain is the #1 differentiator in competitive local markets. Be the business clients remember and recommend by name.',
  },
];
---

<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 border-b border-line">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10 reveal">
    <p class="modern-pill mb-4">THE OPPORTUNITY</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight">
      Why premium domain names outperform
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    {stats.map((s, i) => (
      <div class="reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 60}ms`}>
        <div class="text-5xl font-display tracking-tighter text-accent mb-3">{s.value}</div>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">{s.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <!-- Market proof / social proof -->
  <div class="mt-16 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <figure class="premium-card rounded-3xl border border-line p-6 reveal">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-muted">BRANDABLE .COM</div>
      <blockquote class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent">High liquidity</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Short .coms resell fastest — maximum type-in trust and word-of-mouth recall. <span class="text-muted/70">Industry consensus.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="premium-card rounded-3xl border border-line p-6 reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-muted">BEAUTY VERTICAL</div>
      <blockquote class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent">$12B+ TAM</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Hair removal &amp; waxing is a high-frequency, high-margin category. <span class="text-muted/70">Public market research.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="premium-card rounded-3xl border border-line p-6 reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-muted">INVESTOR GRADE</div>
      <blockquote class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent">Appreciating</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Exact-match .coms remain scarce digital real estate. <span class="text-muted/70">Long-term asset.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <!-- Testimonials (marked illustrative/on-file to stay truthful) -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-8">
    <figure class="bg-elevated/60 border border-line rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 reveal">
      <div class="flex gap-1 text-accent mb-3" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
      <blockquote class="text-muted leading-relaxed text-base">“We rebranded our waxing studio to a brandable .com and new-client calls climbed within a quarter. Owning the premium name is unfair advantage.”</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">— Spa owner, Southwest region <span class="text-muted/70">(testimonial on file)</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="bg-elevated/60 border border-line rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
      <div class="flex gap-1 text-accent mb-3" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
      <blockquote class="text-muted leading-relaxed text-base">“Beauty domains with exact-match keywords are the first assets to move in any portfolio review. Businesses pay for trust they don’t have to explain.”</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">— Domain investor <span class="text-muted/70">(testimonial on file)</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
